      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="2" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 48px;&quot;&gt;UC05&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="120" x="-910" y="-110" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="3" parent="1" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=endState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#ff0000;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="40" width="40" x="-20" y="0" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="4" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="1. The Tourist opens the &quot;Ratings&quot; section on the tour details and taps the &quot;Report&quot; button (flag icon) on another person's comment." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="105" width="220" x="-110" y="90" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="5" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="2. The client opens the &quot;Report a violating rating&quot; dialog; the Actor picks a reason (Spam/Advertising, Hate speech/Insults, False information/Off-topic, Other) and enters an extra description (optional, at most 500 characters)." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="150" width="220" x="-110" y="255" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="6" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="3. The Actor taps &quot;Send report&quot;; the client validates it and calls the report API." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="75" width="220" x="-110" y="465" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="7" parent="1" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shapeInside=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="4. The server checks: signed in, public tour, the rating is still visible, not reporting one's own rating, has not reported this rating before; valid? E1–E4." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="175" width="320" x="-160" y="600" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="8" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="5. The server stores the report in tour_rating_reports (PENDING); if the total number of PENDING reports reaches the threshold N ≥ 3, it sets is_flagged = true automatically (201)." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="120" width="220" x="-110" y="835" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="9" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="6. The client closes the modal and shows &quot;Your report has been sent and is waiting for an administrator to review it.&quot;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="220" x="-110" y="1015" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="10" parent="1" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shapeInside=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="7. The Admin opens the &quot;Rating complaints&quot; page (/admin/reports/ratings); the system checks the Admin role and loads the status=pending queue (flagged first, then author complaints, then newest)? A2, E5." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="190" width="320" x="-160" y="1165" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="11" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="8. The Admin chooses &quot;Remove rating&quot; or &quot;Dismiss report&quot;, enters a handling note (optional) in the confirmation dialog and taps &quot;Confirm&quot;." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="105" width="220" x="-110" y="1415" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="12" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="9. The client calls the report handling API with the action (REMOVE_RATING or DISMISS) and the handling note." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="220" x="-110" y="1580" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="13" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="10. The server handles it in one transaction: every PENDING report of the rating changes status; DISMISS → DISMISSED and is_flagged = false; REMOVE_RATING → RESOLVED, sets is_hidden = true and recomputes average_rating and rating_count with atomic SQL (only once)." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="165" width="220" x="-110" y="1730" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="14" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="11. The client shows &quot;Report handled successfully&quot; and refreshes the queue." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="75" width="220" x="-110" y="1955" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="15" parent="1" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=endState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#ff0000;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="40" width="40" x="-20" y="2120" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="16" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="E1. Not signed in → &quot;Please sign in to report a violation&quot; and go to sign-in (UC#01) (401)." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="75" width="250" x="355" y="603" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="17" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="E2. Reporting one's own rating → the button is hidden in the UI; calling the API directly returns 400." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="75" width="250" x="355" y="708" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="18" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="E3. This rating was already reported (any status) → 409, the dialog shows &quot;You have already reported this rating&quot;." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="250" x="355" y="813" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="19" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="E4. The tour is not public, the rating was deleted or removed, or the reportId does not exist → 404." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="75" width="250" x="355" y="933" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="20" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="E5. The account does not have the Admin role → 403; no token → 401." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="250" x="355" y="1190" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="21" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="A1.1. The tour author (Author) opens the &quot;Ratings&quot; section on their own tour details and taps the &quot;Complain&quot; button on a comment; the client opens the &quot;Rating complaint&quot; dialog." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="120" width="220" x="-510" y="225" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="22" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="A1.2. The Author picks a reason and enters a detailed explanation (optional); the server stores reporter_role = 'AUTHOR' and the Admin queue shows the &quot;Complaint from the Author&quot; label." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="135" width="220" x="-510" y="395" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="23" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="A2.1. The Admin switches between the &quot;Pending&quot;, &quot;Removed&quot; and &quot;Dismissed&quot; tabs on /admin/reports/ratings to look up handled reports." vertex="1">
